    "https://middleburyvt.myrec.com/info/activities/program_details.aspx?ProgramID=29950": "<span id=\"Content_lblProgramName\">Self Defense Aiki Jitsu Adults Program</span><div class=\"program-description\">\r\n\t\t\t<span id=\"Content_lblDescription\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">September 16th - December 9th&nbsp;</span><br /><br /><em><strong>Cost:$50.00</strong></em><br />Ages:14+&nbsp;<br />Maximum:Class Size:10<br />Instructor:&nbsp;[instructor details removed]&nbsp;<br /></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">Aiki&nbsp;Jitsu is a dynamic, self-defense oriented&nbsp;marital art encompassing strikes, throws, joint locks, and ground fighting. It focuses on using leverage and body mechanics to allow a smaller person to defeat a larger, stronger attacker.</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;<br /><br /></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">No experience&nbsp;needed&nbsp;(but welcome if you have some!)</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">Come ready to learn and enjoy a challenging and dynamic work out!</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;<br /></span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">Schedule:&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">Morning Classes:</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;Monday, Friday 9:00 &ndash; 10:30 AM</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">Evening Classes:</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">&nbsp;Monday, Wednesday, Friday 7:00 &ndash; 8:30 PM</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\"><br />**Note: Signing up will enable you to&nbsp;participate&nbsp;in any combination of morning and evening classes.</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;<br /></span></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-contrast=\"none\">Students will need to&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;their own Judo Gi with white belt before class (Available at awma.com, amazon.com, or sporting goods stores). Note that a karate,&nbsp;taekwondo&nbsp;or ju-jitsu&nbsp;gi&nbsp;will be unlikely to stand up to the strain of throwing techniques. Students without a suitable&nbsp;gi&nbsp;will not be able to&nbsp;participate&nbsp;in throwing techniques.&nbsp;</span><span style=